t  these otherworldly concepts will make it  into chapter 2 the trailer appears to  confirm it the losers hit the sewers to  track down penny wise and come upon a  giant spiky object we see the gang  holding hands and looking up the ceiling  or more likely something beyond the  ceiling we never get a glimpse of the  creature in the trailer but we imagine  we hope it'll be more frightening than  that thing we saw in the miniseries we  know moosh Yeti plans to bring the  interdimensional elements of it to the  big screen in chapter 2 and this is our  first look at how that might happen  scared  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite films are coming soon  subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Applause]  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]
 

